From: luowyang
Subject: [PATCH] Fix torch.compile self-attention fallback logging

Backport of https://github.com/SHI-Labs/NATTEN/pull/346 (head f04978021050ab51d76fbd3045f4466a1a950783),
fixing https://github.com/SHI-Labs/NATTEN/issues/345: an eagerly formatted
debug f-string breaks fullgraph torch.compile with dynamic shapes. The
tests/ hunk is dropped because the sdist does not ship tests.

diff --git a/src/natten/functional.py b/src/natten/functional.py
index 00f09482..1cda6ec8 100644
--- a/src/natten/functional.py
+++ b/src/natten/functional.py
@@ -408,8 +408,13 @@ def neighborhood_attention_generic(
         has_additional_attention=has_additional_attention,
     ):
         logger.debug(
-            f"{query.shape=} with {kernel_size=}, {has_additional_attention=} and {is_causal=} is "
-            "self attention. Calling attention instead of neighborhood attention directly."
+            "query.shape=%s with kernel_size=%s, has_additional_attention=%s and "
+            "is_causal=%s is self attention. Calling attention instead of neighborhood "
+            "attention directly.",
+            query.shape,
+            kernel_size,
+            has_additional_attention,
+            is_causal,
         )
 
         query_shape = query.shape
